# No line-ending churn between this Windows working copy and the checkout the CI runner
# builds: one rule for every text file, decided by the file's own content.
* text=auto

# These must come AFTER the blanket rule above -- in gitattributes the last matching line
# wins, so putting them first silently gives the SWF back to "auto". The keycap SWFs and
# anything else shipped as-is must never be touched by git's end-of-line handling: a byte
# changed in a .swf is a broken keycap in the installer.
*.swf binary
*.dll binary
*.pdb binary
*.7z  binary
*.png binary
